      "bodySnippet": "Simplanet Note\nSign in\nGet started free\nFree to start · No credit card required\nYour notes,\norganized and shared\n\nA modern note-taking workspace for individuals and teams. Write, organize, collaborate, and share — all in one place.\n\nStart for free\nSign in\nSimplanet Note\nWORKSPACE\n📝 All Notes\n👥 Shared\n🗑️ Trash\nNOTEBOOKS\n📓 Work\n📓 Personal\nQ4 Planning\nUpdated just now\nMeeting Notes\nUpdated just now\nProduct Roadmap\nUpdated just now\nIdeas\nUpdated just now\nQ4 Planning\nEverything you need\n\nBuilt for people who take notes seriously. Simple enough for personal use, powerful enough for teams.\n\n📝\nRich Text Editor\n\nWrite with a powerful editor supporting headings, lists, code blocks, images, and more.\n\n📓\nNotebooks & Tags\n\nOrganize notes into notebooks and tag them for lightning-fast retrieval.\n"
    },
